{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0\u300eBOOMEROAD\u300f</h2><strong>BOOMEROAD is an exhilarating action-adventure game in which players slide along boomerang rails you will create.<br>You will be playing as the main character, Boomy. Boomy has to reach a tower with a mysterious boomerang while overcoming the obstacles and aims for the Ancient Tower.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bcA new experience in the vast sky</h2><strong>The game is set in an ancient ruin floating in the sky, and the player slides through the vast skies at their own will while searching for the Artifacts.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512820/extras/6b769c0c2584049999d9da622a03ecbe.poster.avif?t=1727242111\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512820/extras/6b769c0c2584049999d9da622a03ecbe.webm?t=1727242111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512820/extras/6b769c0c2584049999d9da622a03ecbe.mp4?t=1727242111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bcAiming, throwing, and sliding. Easy operation and exhilarating action</h2><strong>The exhilarating action with the &quot;rail-drawing boomerang&quot; is the charm of this game.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512820/extras/ea1bf917bf8777efed87cf0347591490.poster.avif?t=1727242111\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512820/extras/ea1bf917bf8777efed87cf0347591490.webm?t=1727242111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512820/extras/ea1bf917bf8777efed87cf0347591490.mp4?t=1727242111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bcNumerous gimmicks to make the action more fun</h2><strong>You will aim for the Ancient Tower with the boomerang while dodging lasers and using a blower to generate wind on several occasions.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512820/extras/c676e61e75000c3aa21676ed4db2997f.poster.avif?t=1727242111\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512820/extras/c676e61e75000c3aa21676ed4db2997f.webm?t=1727242111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512820/extras/c676e61e75000c3aa21676ed4db2997f.mp4?t=1727242111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0&quot;TimeAttackMode&quot; to test your skills</h2><strong>Choose efficient routes and skillfully handle boomerangs to reach the goal quickly.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512820/extras/ac8314724f263e336aa6eb36420da891.poster.avif?t=1727242111\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512820/extras/ac8314724f263e336aa6eb36420da891.webm?t=1727242111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512820/extras/ac8314724f263e336aa6eb36420da891.mp4?t=1727242111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0The setting is an ancient ruin floating in the sky</h2><strong>The game is set in an ancient ruin floating in the sky.<br>Boomy, a young archaeologist boy, visits the ruins as he believes in the legend that there are hidden treasures of an ancient civilization in the towers of the ruins.<br>Using one of the ruin's artifacts,  a boomerang that can draw rails, he adventures through the ruins, which are shrouded in the veil of secrecy.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bcThe Ancient City area is where you can enjoy the clear sky</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512820/extras/025c4fde896bb821e874538ae4c3c0e2.poster.avif?t=1727242111\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512820/extras/025c4fde896bb821e874538ae4c3c0e2.webm?t=1727242111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512820/extras/025c4fde896bb821e874538ae4c3c0e2.mp4?t=1727242111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bcThe Ancient Fortress City area is where you can immerse yourself in the shining moonlit night view</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512820/extras/ffdae1936b380880edab4165976cd6d2.poster.avif?t=1727242111\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512820/extras/ffdae1936b380880edab4165976cd6d2.webm?t=1727242111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512820/extras/ffdae1936b380880edab4165976cd6d2.mp4?t=1727242111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bcCollect the &quot;Oparts&quot; hidden in the ancient ruins</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512820/extras/c9e32730b17a441121c969cb39c8c315.avif?t=1727242111\" width=205 height=205 /></span><span cl